    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fantasketch&quot; is a new kind of puzzle action game where the characters you draw come to life and move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the shape and color of your self-drawn character to overcome the gimmicks and traps set in each stage! Draw a square for a stable foothold, a circle for easy rolling, and a triangle is perfect for slopes. Furthermore, different colors can make your character burn or stick, making the combination of shape and color the key to conquering each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is developed with the official permission of Kiguteam, the developers of &quot;Stack Graffiti&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fantasketch&quot; is a new kind of puzzle action game where the characters you draw come to life and move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the shape and color of your self-drawn character to overcome the gimmicks and traps set in each stage! Draw a square for a stable foothold, a circle for easy rolling, and a triangle is perfect for slopes. Furthermore, different colors can make your character burn or stick, making the combination of shape and color the key to conquering each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is developed with the official permission of Kiguteam, the developers of &quot;Stack Graffiti&quot;.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Fantasketch&quot; is a new kind of puzzle action game where the characters you draw come to life and move! Control your character and aim for the goal!",
